  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A diary from the 1950s is said to show a meeting with the president on the very day that President Dwight D. Eisenhower was supposedly briefed on UFOs, according to the Majestic 12 papers. Those papers claim that a secret group of officials, called Majestic 12, handled the matter. Michels raises this himself in 2024, saying a diary he calls Duell's has come out and records \"meeting with the president\" on that day. In a 2025 episode, crediting the researcher Richard Dolan, he puts it more broadly: the papers knew of meetings and diary entries, which he there calls Dulles's, that \"no other source did.\" If that holds, the papers' authors had inside knowledge."
